        "text": "# INSTRUCTIONS\n\n1. Brainstorm 50 different Instagram carousel ideas related to the theme \"AI and Tech Founder Quotes\".\n2. Randomly select 1 of the ideas.\n3. Output a JSON containing an Instagram caption and array of 3 Instagram scenes.\n   - Each scene must include a high-quality AI image prompt featuring a human (preferably a tech founder) and a robot.\n   - The quote should be a real or paraphrased recent AI-related thought from Elon Musk or other leading founders.\n   - Overlay the quote directly in the image, using bold, readable font.\n   - Scenes should look cinematic, clean, and ultrarealistic.\n\n# OUTPUT FORMAT\n\n{\n  \"caption\": \"Latest AI thoughts from top tech minds like Elon Musk and others.\",\n  \"scenes\": [\n    {\n      \"prompt\": \"A hyper-realistic portrait of Elon Musk standing beside a humanoid robot, set in a high-tech lab environment, with soft neon lighting. Overlay a recent AI quote from Elon Musk in bold, clean font at the bottom of the image.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"prompt\": \"An ultra-detailed image of a futuristic boardroom with diverse tech founders (like Sundar Pichai and Sam Altman) discussing AI ethics with robots. Overlay a short quote about the future of AI.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"prompt\": \"A cinematic shot of a young Black founder shaking hands with an android, standing in front of a glowing city skyline. Add an inspiring AI quote overlay in the center, in elegant white type.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "returnIntermediateSteps": false
        }
